---
// „— KAPITEL · Nº 03“ über den Überschriften
interface Props { wort?: string; nummer: string; hell?: boolean }
const { wort = 'Kapitel', nummer, hell = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['tagline', { hell }]}>
  <span class="strich" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="wort">{wort}</span>
  <span class="nr">· Nº {nummer}</span>
</div>
<style>
  .tagline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:1.5rem}
  .strich{width:18px;height:1px;}
  .wort{font-size:11px;line-height:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.42px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-stumpf)}
  .nr{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;line-height:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2.42px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-stumpf)}
  .strich{background:var(--ink-stumpf)}
  .hell .strich{background:#fff}
  .hell .wort{color:#fff}
  .hell .nr{color:var(--paper-bone)}
</style>
